  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SK Finance Supporting Financing for Micro, Small, and Medium-Sized Enterprises and Electric Vehicles Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails the Asian Development Bank (ADB) providing a long-term loan to SK Finance Limited (SKF) to support (i) lending to micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs), with at least 60 percent of the financing for MSMEs to be provided to micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises owned or led by women (WMSMEs); and (ii) lending for the purchase of electric vehicles. The project supports the Government of India to meet its updated Nationally Determined Contribution (NDC) targets and promotes financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
